<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Guidant lowered on price.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Guidant lowered on price.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said analyst Jill Topkis Weiss downgraded Guidant Corp to accumulate from buy due to the stock's current valuation.</p>
<p>-- In a report the analyst said the stock should be bought on weakness or for the long term.</p>
<p>-- The shares were off 1-5/8 to 54-5/8</p>
</text>
